; The documented rule shape: measure, then hand dune the candidate to
; diff. No (universe), no no-infer copy: an unchanged exe + baseline is a
; cache hit, and diff? tolerates the candidate's absence on a pass.
; (--quick keeps the cram scenario fast; the shipped template is flagless.)

(rule
 (alias bench)
 (locks bench)
 (action
  (progn
   (run %{exe:bench.exe} --quick)
   (diff? fixture.thumper fixture.thumper.corrected))))
